      "speaker": "Astra",
      "text": "A concrete task is now available, so the earlier \u201cno task\u201d conclusion no longer applies. Work from the island puzzle itself, not the old notes. Pay attention to the logical wording of each statement, and submit your proposed assignment when ready. A submitted answer remains a proposal until the environment returns a check."
